{#
  partials/disclaimer.njk — the one disclaimer banner.

  Usage: set `disclaimer` before including.
    {% set disclaimer = { title: "Disclaimer", preset: "not-proof", body: "One more sentence." } %}
    {% include "partials/disclaimer.njk" %}

  Fields:
    title   optional; the bold heading, "Disclaimer" when omitted
    preset  optional; "not-proof" prints the site's one shared sentence that an
            entry is not proof and is a lead to verify
    body    optional; further text, which may contain inline HTML
    id      optional; an anchor id for the banner

  The markup stays free of blank lines because src/etherhiding/index.md
  includes it through Markdown, where a blank line ends an HTML block.
  partials/profile-disclaimer.njk is the separate profile banner.
#}
<div class="disclaimer-banner"{% if disclaimer.id %} id="{{ disclaimer.id }}"{% endif %}>
<strong>{{ disclaimer.title or "Disclaimer" }}</strong>
{%- if disclaimer.preset == "not-proof" %}
An entry here is not proof of DPRK affiliation or wrongdoing. A listed name, account or address may belong to an uninvolved person, so each entry is a lead to verify independently. <a href="/about/#disclaimer">What inclusion means</a>.
{%- endif %}
{%- if disclaimer.body %}
{{ disclaimer.body | safe }}
{%- endif %}
</div>
